+# picasso (SM7250) kernel adaptation
+
+This patch set carries the SM7250-specific build-side additions that the pinned
+upstream UniXNU tree does not provide for picasso. It is applied on top of the
+upstream revision pinned by upstream.rev by the ./unixnu wrapper.
+
+## Contents
+
+- scripts/build-arm-driver.py: compiles the generic ArmDTPlatform / ArmCpu /
+  ArmVirtPlatform drivers against the actual source-kernel ABI by replaying the
+  kernel's own IOPlatformExpert compile recipe, then audits and archives the
+  object. Board [kernel] archives entries reference this script; upstream only
+  ships it implicitly through the sheng device repository.
+
+## Stage
+
+First-console bring-up: corecrypto (upstream builder), ArmDTPlatform and ArmCpu
+archives, architectural timer, PAN, DT panic region and the trust cache
+runtime. UFS / VirtIO / display / Adreno archives join the [kernel] archives
+list of board.toml in later stages.
diff --git a/scripts/build-arm-driver.py b/scripts/build-arm-driver.py
